GIMP Palette
Name: Volcano CPC Mode 0
Columns: 4
# Τα 16 pens του Mode 0, από τα 27 χρώματα του firmware.
# Η στήλη FW είναι ο αριθμός για SCR SET INK / Gate Array.
#
  0   0   0	pen 00  FW 00  Black
  0   0 128	pen 01  FW 01  Blue
128   0   0	pen 02  FW 03  Red
128 128   0	pen 03  FW 12  Yellow
128 128 128	pen 04  FW 13  White
255   0   0	pen 05  FW 06  Bright red
255 128   0	pen 06  FW 15  Orange
255 255   0	pen 07  FW 24  Bright yellow
128   0 128	pen 08  FW 04  Magenta
255   0 128	pen 09  FW 07  Purple
  0 128   0	pen 10  FW 09  Green
128 255   0	pen 11  FW 21  Lime
255 128 128	pen 12  FW 16  Pink
255 255 128	pen 13  FW 25  Pastel yellow
128 128 255	pen 14  FW 14  Pastel blue
255 255 255	pen 15  FW 26  Bright white
